      "text": "You are in Warsong Gulch, a contested field of strife in the Ashenvale forest. Alliance forces defend Silverwing Hold here, and Horde forces, who say Kalimdor belongs to them, contest the gulch. Horde forces are said to be cutting down the evergreens here to power their war machines. Corpus Ragatus is among the hostile creatures found here.",
